  /*
     The dot marks which of a set of choices is current - one camera, one
     number of players. Mute is not one of a set, it is a switch, and giving it
     the dot made *muted* look like the selected state and sound-on look
     inactive, which is backwards. The icon says which way it is set.
  */
  #modes button:not(#mute)[aria-pressed='true']::before,
